# <type>(<scope>): <imperative summary>
#
# Explain why the change is needed and call out important design decisions.
# Keep the subject concise; wrap body lines near 72 characters.
#
# Types: feat, fix, rtl, test, docs, refactor, build, ci, chore, revert
# Scopes: rtl, tb, docs, tooling, ci, or a specific module/component
#
# Examples:
# feat(rtl): add parameterized counter
# test(counter): verify rollover behavior
# docs(architecture): define clock and reset policy
# fix(tb): correct reset sequencing

